=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dignity_intact.\" title=\"Dignity intact.\">Dignity intact.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_leprechaun_or_the_lesbian.\" title=\"The leprechaun or the lesbian.\">The leprechaun or the lesbian.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Phoenix.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Residue_around_the_hoof.\" title=\"Residue around the hoof.\">Residue around the hoof.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_wind-dried_puffin.\" title=\"A wind-dried puffin.\">A wind-dried puffin.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spoony_Neeson.\" title=\"Spoony Neeson.\">Spoony Neeson.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boing_boing.\" title=\"Boing boing.\">Boing boing.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Their_water%27s_so_delicious.\" title=\"Their water&#39;s so delicious.\">Their water's so delicious.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Phoenix.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a3/Phoenix..png/revision/latest?cb=20210125094608\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Phoenix.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a3/Phoenix..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210125094608\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a3/Phoenix..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210125094608 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a3/Phoenix..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210125094608 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Phoenix.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Phoenix..png\" data-image-name=\"Phoenix..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_5\" title=\"Series 5\">5</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bob_Mortimer\" title=\"Bob Mortimer\">Bob Mortimer</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_leprechaun_or_the_lesbian.\" title=\"The leprechaun or the lesbian.\">The leprechaun or the lesbian.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Residue_around_the_hoof.\" title=\"Residue around the hoof.\">Residue around the hoof.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Phoenix.</b></i> is the third episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_5\" title=\"Series 5\">Series 5</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 27 September 2017. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Bob_Mortimer\" title=\"Bob Mortimer\">Bob Mortimer</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Phoenix.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Phoenix\" was a word uttered by <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> during the <a href=\"/wiki/Play_table_tennis_with_words\" title=\"Play table tennis with words\">Play table tennis with words</a> task. The title card depicts a red jelly from the <a href=\"/wiki/Eat_one_item,_throw_one_item,_balance_one_item\" title=\"Eat one item, throw one item, balance one item\">Eat one item, throw one item, balance one item</a> task on a green plate with a spoon.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Phoenix.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3><p>\nOn Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Feeniks', which translates as 'Phoenix'.</p><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Phoenix.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Aisling_Bea\" title=\"Aisling Bea\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Aisling Bea</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Bob_Mortimer\" title=\"Bob Mortimer\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Bob Mortimer</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mark_Watson\" title=\"Mark Watson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mark Watson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Nish_Kumar\" title=\"Nish Kumar\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Nish Kumar</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sally_Phillips\" title=\"Sally Phillips\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sally Phillips</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_thing_they%27re_actually_proudest_of\" title=\"The thing they&#39;re actually proudest of\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> The thing they're actually proudest of.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Remove_the_table_tennis_ball_from_the_pipe\" title=\"Remove the table tennis ball from the pipe\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Remove the table tennis ball from the pipe. The pipe must not move.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_this_coconut_look_like_a_businessman\" title=\"Make this coconut look like a businessman\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make this coconut look like a businessman.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eat_one_item,_throw_one_item,_balance_one_item\" title=\"Eat one item, throw one item, balance one item\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td><small><i>Items: Jelly, Weetabix, Twiglet</i></small> <br />Eat one item.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">2\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">3\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">0\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Balance one item on top of the red pole. The item must stay balanced until the entire task is complete. You may not take the pole out of the ground.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Standing behind this rope, throw one item into the bucket. You may retrieve the item if it misses, but you must be stood behind the rope on every throw. You may not move the rope or the bucket.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Play_table_tennis_with_words\" title=\"Play table tennis with words\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Play table tennis with words. When the ball is within striking distance, you must say a word while pretending to hit the ball with your bat. That word must begin with the last letter of the previous word. If you fail to say a word within the time it would take you to hit a ball, you are out. After saying a word, you must run to the back of the opposite queue.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">17\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Phoenix.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Video\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><small><i>Video unavailable in some regions. Find an alternative service <a href=\"/wiki/Watch_Taskmaster\" title=\"Watch Taskmaster\">here</a>.</i></small>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"> <a href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/File:Taskmaster_-_Series_5,_Episode_3_-_Full_Episode_-_%27Phoenix.%27\" class=\"video video-thumbnail medium \"> \t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/6/64/Taskmaster_-_Series_5%2C_Episode_3_-_Full_Episode_-_%27Phoenix.%27/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20210130003914\" alt=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_5,_Episode_3_-_Full_Episode_-_&#39;Phoenix.&#39;\" height=\"263\" width=\"350\" data-video-key=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_5,_Episode_3_-_Full_Episode_-_&#39;Phoenix.&#39;\" data-video-name=\"Taskmaster - Series 5, Episode 3 - Full Episode - &#39;Phoenix.&#39;\" class=\"\" /> \t<span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"> \t\t<svg class=\"thumbnail-play-icon wds-icon\" ari